# tools/ excluded: workspace members not needed at runtime (and tools/bench was missing from the lockfile).
# Kept: what tools/agent-bridge/install/build.mjs needs to make the installer the site serves at /install/ (P26-14): the bridge
# workspace member, its fake agent and the pod tools it bundles. The node_modules and dist rules come LAST: a later `!` line would
# otherwise bring a member's node_modules back into the context (a 4.5 GB image, 2026-11-16).
.git
e2e
docs
deploy
!deploy/images/agent-pod
!deploy/images/workbench
tools
!tools/agent-bridge
!tools/fake-acp-agent
tools/agent-bridge/spike
tools/agent-bridge/test
**/node_modules
**/dist
